// A labelled block carrying a literal-union value (owner ruling 2026-09-29): its result binding
// is spelled by the members, not by the softened `string` emit name, so the value stays an i32
// atom. The proof compares against a member, which only the atom rep answers right.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/matrix.py, whose docstring is the spec.
// @@PRELUDE@@
type AB = "a" | "b"
function pickB(): AB { "b" }
function seven(): i32 { 7 }
// @@VALUE@@
(B: { if seven() > 9 { break :B pickB() }; pickB() })
// @@TYPE@@
AB
// @@PROOF@@
if v == "b" { print("b") } else { print("other") }
// @@WANT@@
b
